# Netlify response headers.
#
# ---- Security (every page) ------------------------------------------
# Content-Security-Policy is the browser's allow-list: this site may only
# run its own scripts, load its own styles, fonts and pictures, send forms
# to Web3Forms and show the Google map. Anything injected from elsewhere
# (a hacked ad, a malicious link, a browser-extension trick) is refused.
#   'sha256-…'  is the one small script written inside index.html. If that
#               script changes, `npm run build` stops and prints the new
#               value to paste here AND in vercel.json.
#   Adding a new outside service (a video, a payment widget…)? Add its
#   address to the matching line here and in vercel.json.
# The other lines stop the site being framed by other sites (clickjacking),
# stop browsers guessing file types, keep the address bar private when
# visitors follow links out, and switch off camera, microphone and location.
#
# `npm run preview` and `npm test` serve these same headers, so a blocked
# resource shows up as a test failure before it reaches the live site.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-irPWIMCOb6qmOileIIAaulDxdNhq0iq98OxbZQ5k0Fo='; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.web3forms.com; frame-src https://www.google.com https://maps.google.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none

# ---- Caching --------------------------------------------------------
# Files whose names contain a content hash never change: when the content
# changes, the name changes too. So browsers may keep them for a year and
# repeat visits load them instantly, without even asking the server.
#   /assets/…                      the site's JavaScript, CSS and fonts (from Vite)
#   /images/projects/<id>/_w/…     the gallery's WebP copies (from
#                                  scripts/project-photos.mjs)

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/images/projects/:project/_w/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
